  416 001025             ! ------------------------------------------------------------
  417 001025             ! GCLEAR via Printer/Plotter ROM 360.
  418 001025             !
  419 001025             ! ROM360 token 5 (GCLEAR) has runtime entry 064557 octal.
  420 001025             ! This uses the same device-aware graphics layer as the SCALE
  421 001025             ! and PEN calls below.  No optional parameter is supplied.
  422 001025             ! ------------------------------------------------------------
  423 001025             
  424 001025 316 376 011         JSB =ROMJSB
  425 001030 157 151             DEF PPGCLR
  426 001032 360                 BYT 360
