  474 001117             ! PEN j via Printer/Plotter ROM 360.
  475 001117             !
  476 001117             ! ROM360 token 17 (PEN) has runtime entry 064241 octal.
  477 001117             ! Reload the original evaluated REAL j and push it unchanged.
  478 001117             ! The ROM itself implements the HP PEN semantics; SIMON85 does
  479 001117             ! not validate, clamp or otherwise transform j.
  480 001117             ! ------------------------------------------------------------
  481 001117             
  482 001117 114 261 233         LDMD R14,=BINTAB
