 1432 003253             ! ============================================================
 1433 003253             ! LCLIP -- Cohen-Sutherland segment clipper for LINE f=0/f=2
 1434 003253             !
 1435 003253             ! Works entirely on mapped HP REAL coordinates:
 1436 003253             !
 1437 003253             !       MX1,MY1  -> endpoint 1
 1438 003253             !       MX2,MY2  -> endpoint 2
 1439 003253             !
 1440 003253             ! Outcode bits:
 1441 003253             !
 1442 003253             !       1       LEFT    x < 0
 1443 003253             !       2       RIGHT   x > 255
 1444 003253             !       4       BOTTOM  y < 0
 1445 003253             !       10      TOP     y > 191       (octal bit value = 8 dec)
 1446 003253             !
 1447 003253             ! LCLCHK evaluates accept/reject/clip-one-endpoint state.
 1448 003253             ! LCLONE computes one boundary intersection and replaces the
 1449 003253             ! selected endpoint.  A 10-iteration guard prevents pathological
 1450 003253             ! floating-point round-off from looping indefinitely.
