 2026 005025             ! PLMODE / PLMOVE / PLDRAW -- ARC/CIRCLE streamed polyline path
 2027 005025             !
 2028 005025             ! PLMODE converts the composite primitive's REAL SF mode once and caches
 2029 005025             ! it in LMODE.  PLMOVE emits the initial ROM360 MOVE only for f=1.
 2030 005025             ! PLDRAW then emits only DRAW endpoints for f=1; f=0/f=2 continue through
