 3458 011177             ! ------------------------------------------------------------
 3459 011177             ! v0.09l: BIDIRECTIONAL INDEXED WORK-LIST FILL.
 3460 011177             !
 3461 011177             ! v0.09k physically proved the complete repeated indexed DOWN-list path,
 3462 011177             ! including branching, rejoining and stale-seed rejection.  v0.09l keeps
 3463 011177             ! that DOWN implementation unchanged and adds the symmetric indexed UP list.
 3464 011177             !
 3465 011177             ! For every successfully filled scanline:
 3466 011177             !
 3467 011177             !       1. scan logical row y-1 within [PLFT,PRGT] and queue every
 3468 011177             !          contiguous PSRC run on the DOWN list
 3469 011177             !       2. scan logical row y+1 within [PLFT,PRGT] and queue every
 3470 011177             !          contiguous PSRC run on the UP list
 3471 011177             !       3. return to the dispatcher
 3472 011177             !
 3473 011177             ! The dispatcher processes DOWN entries whenever available; if DOWN is
 3474 011177             ! empty it processes one UP entry.  Processing either direction may queue
 3475 011177             ! new entries in both lists, so filling ends only when BOTH counts are zero.
 3476 011177             !
 3477 011177             ! PDCNT / PUCNT are one-byte entry counts.  Push/pop always recompute:
 3478 011177             !
Page   63                                                             
CAPASM

 3479 011177             !       address = BINTAB + PDSTK/PUSTK + (index * 4)
 3480 011177             !
 3481 011177             ! Each entry is four bytes: Xlo,Xhi,Ylo,Yhi.  PFSEED remains the proven
 3482 011177             ! one-row dynamic-span primitive.  PFKACT ensures stale duplicate entries
 3483 011177             ! do not propagate using old span state.
 3484 011177             ! ------------------------------------------------------------
 3485 011177             
 3486 011177 114 261 233 PINIT   LDMD R14,=BINTAB
      011202 202 
