 4578 014222             ! TEST RUNTIME -- v0.10c CRT PIXEL FUNCTION
 4579 014222             !
 4580 014222             !       TEST(x,y)
 4581 014222             !
 4582 014222             ! HP-83/85 function attributes immediately precede the runtime:
 4583 014222             !
 4584 014222             !       40 octal = two parameters, both numeric
 4585 014222             !       55 octal = numeric system function
 4586 014222             !
 4587 014222             ! The function parser/return mechanism is unchanged from the
 4588 014222             ! hardware-verified v0.10b diagnostic.
 4589 014222             !
 4590 014222             ! Result:
 4591 014222             !       0 = mapped CRT pixel is clear, or mapped point is off-screen
 4592 014222             !       1 = mapped CRT pixel is set
 4593 014222             !
 4594 014222             ! TEST is CRT-only; no plotter output is generated.
